00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,370
integration, different school lives. A.

2
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:14,830
Toby is an exchange student from the USA and is studying at Sunshine Middle School now.

3
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:20,760
He is comparing his school in the USA with Sunshine Middle School.

4
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:26,800
Read what he wrote and answer the questions below.

5
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:35,550
My school back home in the USA is quite different from Sunshine Middle School.

6
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:43,510
Our classes are not as big as the ones here and we have fewer students in each class.

7
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:49,440
Here students stay in their own classroom for most of their lessons.

8
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:57,440
However, in the USA we usually go to different classrooms to have different lessons.

9
00:00:57,440 --> 00:01:11,850
Students here do not change classrooms as often as we do, so they spend more time with their classmates and get to know each other better but we get to know more students.

10
00:01:11,850 --> 00:01:21,570
Students here have students books for most of their subjects but we only have textbooks for a few subjects.

11
00:01:21,570 --> 00:01:28,960
We often need to borrow books from the library or search online to finish our homework.
